C:
The girl in front of you, I never liked her.

She's so nice and easy-going,
I could make up for all the sins I committed since birth,

Her eyes are like the sea, 
they always ask me if it's worth going down there at night to find out what she has to say;

All day long my mind is full of thoughts from your past; 
we were best friends until a time came when I realized we should let go;
If someone told us they loved each other, 

Wouldn't you be able to handle being alone?
